      "writtenOn": "2022-03-08T07:26:21Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "In this case, we also need to confirm that response headers include \"WWW-Authenticate\" [1].\n\n\u003e If the client attempted to authenticate via the \"Authorization\" request header field, the authorization server MUST respond with an HTTP 401 (Unauthorized) status code and include the \"WWW-Authenticate\" response header field matching the authentication scheme used by the client.\n\nhttps://datatracker.ietf.org/doc/html/rfc6749#section-5.2",
      "revId": "edc0aee179f28793b0e1bd842d2642a03e887757",
